ezone.utc), 'created_at__2': datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 9, 5, 4, 33, 940151, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), 'document_id__2': UUID('cb7e198c-8b5b-4643-8c4e-b3c5d87ce322'), 'content__3': 'eal-life issues. [2] explored\nhow artificial intelligence can model the complex relation-\nships between our bodies and our digital footprints. When ... (719 characters truncated) ... uses the social and online activity of the person as a major\ncontributor in one’s stress levels. [7] also reviewed how\nvarious algorithms can predi', 'id__3': UUID('6888afda-6446-4f30-bfd9-2eaf39d9224a'), 'chunk_index__3': 3, 'updated_at__3': datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 9, 5, 4, 33, 940172, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), 'created_at__3': datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 9, 5, 4, 33, 940169, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), 'document_id__3': UUID('cb7e198c-8b5b-4643-8c4e-b3c5d87ce322'), 'content__4': 'g to detect stress within social media text, and [6]\nuses the social and online activity of the person as a major\ncontributor in one’s stress level ... (719 characters truncated) ... complex\nlanguage of these brain signals with high precision. Most\nrecently, [12] have showcased much improvement and ac-\ncuracy in result calculat', 'id__4': UUID('93f66483-3c3a-4a48-a2b7-0c9591f406f4'), 'chunk_index__4': 4, 'updated_at__4': datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 9, 5, 4, 33, 940188, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), 'created_at__4': datetime.datetime(2026, 8, 9, 5, 4, 33, 940186, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), 'document_id__4': UUID('cb7e198c-8b5b-4643-8c4e-b3c5d87ce322'), 'content__5': 'hat\nsophisticated neural architectures can decode the complex\nlanguage of these brain signals with high precision. Most\nrecently, [12] have showca ... (720 characters truncated) ... ons of this work are summarised as fol-\nlows:\n1. A hybrid stress detection framework combining real-\ntime physiological signals and passive social', 'id__5': UUID('735438b6-26f0-4d84-a419-4dcddebaa9c3'), 'chunk_index__5': 5, 'updated_at__5': datetime.dateti